# Headless Component

Expose behavior without forcing the final markup. Build the look with antd or Tailwind at the call site.

The shared carousel in `src/shared/ui` has this role: slide movement stays separate from the product card.

```tsx
function ProductSlider({ products }: { products: Product[] }) {
  return (
    <Carousel label="Products">
      {products.map((product) => (
        <ProductCard key={product.id} product={product} />
      ))}
    </Carousel>
  );
}
```
